{"title": "Right Behind You", "pageid": 49009, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Right_Behind_You", "categories": ["Class actions", "Melee weapon attacks", "Reactions", "Sources of Necrotic damage", "Bugs", "Patch 8 content"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Right_Behind_You.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Right_Behind_You.webp/300px-Right_Behind_You.webp, /w/images/6/6e/Right_Behind_You.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Right_Behind_You.webp/300px-Right_Behind_You.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6e/Right_Behind_You.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Right Behind You</b> is a special reaction available to the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Feeble_Spectre\" title=\"Feeble Spectre\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Portrait_Feeble_Spectre.png/25px-Portrait_Feeble_Spectre.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Portrait_Feeble_Spectre.png/38px-Portrait_Feeble_Spectre.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Portrait_Feeble_Spectre.png/50px-Portrait_Feeble_Spectre.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Feeble Spectre\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Portrait_Feeble_Spectre.png/25px-Portrait_Feeble_Spectre.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Portrait_Feeble_Spectre.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Feeble_Spectre\" title=\"Feeble Spectre\">Feeble Spectre</a>, the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mundane_Spectre\" title=\"Mundane Spectre\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mundane_Spectre.png/25px-Portrait_Mundane_Spectre.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mundane_Spectre.png/38px-Portrait_Mundane_Spectre.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mundane_Spectre.png/50px-Portrait_Mundane_Spectre.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mundane Spectre\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mundane_Spectre.png/25px-Portrait_Mundane_Spectre.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Portrait_Mundane_Spectre.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mundane_Spectre\" title=\"Mundane Spectre\">Mundane Spectre</a>, and the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Primordial_Spectre\" title=\"Primordial Spectre\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/ff/Portrait_Primordial_Spectre.png/25px-Portrait_Primordial_Spectre.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/ff/Portrait_Primordial_Spectre.png/38px-Portrait_Primordial_Spectre.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/ff/Portrait_Primordial_Spectre.png/50px-Portrait_Primordial_Spectre.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Primordial Spectre\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/ff/Portrait_Primordial_Spectre.png/25px-Portrait_Primordial_Spectre.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/ff/Portrait_Primordial_Spectre.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Primordial_Spectre\" title=\"Primordial Spectre\">Primordial Spectre</a>. It can additionally be acquired by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nimbus\" title=\"Nimbus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Portrait_Nimbus.png/25px-Portrait_Nimbus.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Portrait_Nimbus.png/38px-Portrait_Nimbus.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Portrait_Nimbus.png/50px-Portrait_Nimbus.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nimbus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Portrait_Nimbus.png/25px-Portrait_Nimbus.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Portrait_Nimbus.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nimbus\" title=\"Nimbus\">Nimbus</a> by moving adjacent to an accursed spectre.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nMaterialise next to your summoner's victim.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/28px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/42px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/28px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a></dd><dt>Damage: 1~12 + modifiers</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/D12_Necrotic.png/29px-D12_Necrotic.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/D12_Necrotic.png/43px-D12_Necrotic.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/D12_Necrotic.png/58px-D12_Necrotic.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/D12_Necrotic.png/29px-D12_Necrotic.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"29\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/D12_Necrotic.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1d12 + Summoner's Charisma modifier</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee Weapon Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee Weapon <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UIDs</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_RightBehindYou_Specter</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_RightBehindYou_Specter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_RightBehindYou_Specter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Actual attack ability</div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Interrupt_RightBehindYou</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_RightBehindYou\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_RightBehindYou\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Reaction which triggers the attack</div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Interrupt_RightBehindYou_Hound</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_RightBehindYou_Hound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_RightBehindYou_Hound\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Version of the reaction granted to Nimbus</div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Feeble_Spectre\" title=\"Feeble Spectre\">Feeble Spectre</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mundane_Spectre\" title=\"Mundane Spectre\">Mundane Spectre</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Primordial_Spectre\" title=\"Primordial Spectre\">Primordial Spectre</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Nimbus\" title=\"Nimbus\">Nimbus</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This reaction is triggered when the <a href=\"/wiki/Hexblade\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hexblade\">Hexblade</a> hits a target with a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hexed_Weapon_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexed Weapon (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hexed Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hexed_Weapon_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexed Weapon (Condition)\">Hexed Weapon</a>.</li>\n<li>When Nimbus moves within 3 m (10 ft) of an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Accursed_Spectre\" title=\"Accursed Spectre\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Accursed_Spectre_Icon.webp/20px-Accursed_Spectre_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Accursed_Spectre_Icon.webp/30px-Accursed_Spectre_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Accursed_Spectre_Icon.webp/40px-Accursed_Spectre_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Accursed Spectre\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Accursed_Spectre_Icon.webp/20px-Accursed_Spectre_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Accursed_Spectre_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Accursed_Spectre\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Accursed Spectre\">Accursed Spectre</a>, he gains the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Infusion_(Hound_of_Ill_Omen)_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Infusion (Hound of Ill Omen) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Splinter_Shadow_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Splinter_Shadow_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Splinter_Shadow_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Splinter_Shadow_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Splinter_Shadow_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Splinter_Shadow_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow Infusion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Splinter_Shadow_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Splinter_Shadow_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Splinter_Shadow_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Infusion_(Hound_of_Ill_Omen)_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Infusion (Hound of Ill Omen) (Condition)\">Shadow Infusion</a> condition that grants this reaction until a long rest. This version of the reaction is triggered when the sorcerer hits a target with any melee weapon attack and does not require a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hexed_Weapon_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexed Weapon (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hexed Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hexed_Weapon_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexed Weapon (Condition)\">Hexed Weapon</a>. Additionally, the damage is just <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1d12</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> without the bonus from the summoner's Charisma modifier.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This reaction triggers on a killing blow, automatically spending the Reaction point of the summoned creature without providing any effect.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715035739\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.095 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.100 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4431/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 64830/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 24291/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 7/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.028/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1487471/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   84.377      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   84.377      1 -total\n 82.98%   70.017     59 Template:Trim\n 29.05%   24.509     12 Template:Icon_text\n 27.10%   22.866     10 Template:Icon_link\n 18.73%   15.800      4 Template:CharLink\n 16.98%   14.328      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 13.31%   11.229     12 Template:Ifempty\n 